<title>BAHRAIN: TABLE-Saudi Cable Co returns to black in H1 97.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Saudi Cable Co returns to black in H1 97.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		  9.82   vs     9.46 loss</p>
<p> Sales		     450.39   vs   424.10</p>
<p> Operating income	 62.98   vs    42.47</p>
<p> Expenses		   52.87   vs    49.58</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity  507.69   vs   473.05</p>
<p> Assets		  1,455.42   vs 1,491.84</p>
<p>Full Name: The Saudi Cable Company.</p>
<p>Note - Traded in the Saudi market, the firm plans to raise its capital to 500 million riyals from 300 million by a rights issue and bonus shares. No timeframe was given for the capital increase.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
